          "comment": "# Comfy Kling- Virtual Try On\n\nDress a virtual model in any garment by combining a clothing image with a person photo, generating a realistic try-on result alongside a side-by-side comparison view. It accepts flat-lay, mannequin, or on-model clothing shots while preserving the model's face and pose. Ideal for fashion e-commerce previews, styling mockups, and virtual fitting experiences. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_kling_vto.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
